{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-21-1","title":"Jeremiah 21:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Zedekiah sends to Jeremiah to enquire the event of Nebuchadnezzar's war. 3 Jeremiah foretells a hard seige and miserable captivity. 8 He counsels the people to fall to the Chaldeans; 11 and upbraids the King's house.</p>\n<p>A.M. cir. 3415. B.C. cir. 589. The word.This discourse was delivered about the ninth year of the reign of Zedekiah. This chapter, observes Dr. Blayney, contains the first of those prophecies which were delivered by Jeremiah subsequent to the revolt of Zedekiah, and the breaking out of the war thereupon; and which are continued on to the taking of Jerusalem, related in ch. 39, in the following order: ch. 21; 34; 32; 33; 38; 39.</p>\n<p>when. 32:1-3; 37:1; 52:1-3; 2Ki 24:17,18; 1Ch 3:15; 2Ch 36:10-13 Pashur. 38:1; 1Ch 9:12; Ne 11:12 Zephaniah. 29:25; 37:3; 52:24; 2Ki 25:18-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-2","title":"Jeremiah 21:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Enquire. 37:3,7; 38:14-27; 42:4-6; Jud 20:27; 1Sa 10:22; 28:6,15 1Ki 14:2,3; 22:3-8; 2Ki 1:3; 3:11-14; 22:13,14; Eze 14:3-7; 20:1-3 for. 32:24; 39:1,2; 52:3-6; 2Ki 25:1,2 according. Ex 14:1-15:27; Jos 10:1-11:23; Jud 4:1-5:31; 1Sa 7:10-12; 14:6-14 1Sa 17:45-50; 2Ch 14:9-13; 20:1-30; 32:21; Ps 44:1-4; 46:8-11 Ps 48:4-8; 105:5-45; 136:1-26; Isa 59:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-4","title":"Jeremiah 21:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Behold. 32:5; 33:5; 37:8-10; 38:2,3,17,18; 52:18; Isa 10:4; Ho 9:12 and I. 39:3; Isa 5:5; 13:4; La 2:5,7; Eze 16:37-41; Zec 14:2; Mt 22:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-5","title":"Jeremiah 21:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>I. Isa 63:10; La 2:4,5 with an. 32:17; Ex 6:6; 9:15; De 4:23; Isa 5:25; 9:12,17,21; 10:4 Eze 20:33,34; Na 1:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-6","title":"Jeremiah 21:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I will. 7:20; 12:3,4; 33:12; 36:29; Ge 6:7; Isa 6:11; 24:1-6; Eze 14:13,17 Eze 14:19,21; 33:27,29; Ho 4:3; Mic 3:12; Zep 1:3; Lu 21:24 they. 32:24; 34:17; 42:22; Eze 5:12,13; 7:15; 12:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-7","title":"Jeremiah 21:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>I will. 24:8-10; 34:19-22; 37:17; 38:21-23; 39:4-7; 52:8-11,24-27 2Ki 25:5-7,18-21; 2Ch 36:17-20; Eze 12:12-16; 17:20,21; 21:25,26 he shall. 13:14; De 28:50; 2Ch 36:17; Isa 13:17,18; 27:11; 47:6; Eze 7:9 Eze 8:18; 9:5,6,10; Hab 1:6-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-8","title":"Jeremiah 21:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>I set. De 11:26; 30:15,19; Isa 1:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-9","title":"Jeremiah 21:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>that abideth. 7; 27:13; 38:2,17-23 and his. 38:2; 39:18; 45:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-10","title":"Jeremiah 21:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I have. 44:11,27; Le 17:10; 20:3-5; 26:17; Ps 34:16; Eze 15:7; Am 9:4 it shall. 17:27; 26:6; 32:28-31; 34:2,22; 37:8-10; 38:3,18,23; 39:8; 52:13 2Ch 36:19; Zec 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-11","title":"Jeremiah 21:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>13:18; 17:20; Mic 3:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-12","title":"Jeremiah 21:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>house. Isa 7:2,13; Lu 1:69 Execute. Heb. Judge. 5:28; 22:2,3,15-17; 23:5; 2Sa 8:15; Ps 72:1-4,12-14; 82:2-4 Isa 1:17; 16:3-5; 31:1,2; Zec 7:9-11 morning. Ex 18:13; Ps 101:8; Ec 10:16,17; Zep 3:5 deliver. Job 29:17; Ps 82:4; Pr 24:11,12; 31:8,9; Isa 1:17; Lu 18:3-5 Ro 13:4 lest. 5; 4:4; 5:14; 17:4; 23:19; 36:7; Le 26:28; De 32:22; La 2:3,4; 4:11 Eze 20:47,48; 22:18-22,31; 24:8-14; Na 1:6; Zep 1:18 none. 7:20; Isa 1:31; Mr 9:43-48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-13","title":"Jeremiah 21:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>I am. 5; 23:30-32; 50:31; 51:25; Ex 13:8,20 inhabitant. Heb. inhabitress. of the valley. Ps 125:2; Isa 22:1 Who. 7:4; 49:4,5,16; 2Sa 5:6,7; La 4:12; Ob 1:3,4; Mic 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-21-14","title":"Jeremiah 21:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>punish. Heb. visit upon. 9:25; 11:22; Isa 10:12; 24:21; *margins according. 6:29; 17:10; 32:19; Pr 1:31; Isa 3:10,11; Ga 6:7,8 in the. 22:7; Isa 10:18,19; 27:10,11; 37:24; Eze 20:46-48; Zec 11:1 shall. 52:13; 2Ch 36:19</p>"}]}